Package: movo
Version: 0.2.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Movo contributors <noreply@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip, python3-gi, gir1.2-atspi-2.0, at-spi2-core, libxcb-cursor0
Recommends: wmctrl, xdotool, policykit-1
Description: Floating Linux desktop computer-use agent powered by Jev
 Movo is a compact, always-on-top desktop agent that observes the Linux desktop
 via the AT-SPI accessibility tree, builds compact typed candidates, asks
 TypeSafe's Jev System One model for bounded typed decisions, executes real
 mouse and keyboard actions, and verifies each step.
 .
 Jev is the fast decision brain; Movo gives it eyes, hands, a memory of the
 current task, and safety.
